Cell["5. Normalized matrix units and blocks", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6af3ce89-acf6-4ccf-b57a-dfde55f8badb"],

Cell["\<\
The exact construction normalizes off-diagonal matrix units by their trace \
pairing and chooses their signs through the multiplication relations. \
Previously exported elementary files are deliberately not reused.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6e504f4b-5777-414a-b8e9-d3013c9f7526"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[",
   RowBox[{
